WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.488
John Muir came to America from Scotland as an eleven-year-old farm boy in

2
00:00:05.488 --> 00:00:10.819
1849 and grew into the most persuasive voice for keeping wild country wild.

3
00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:14.600
He helped win Yosemite its national park, founded the Sierra

4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.030
Club, and took a president camping among the giant sequoias.

5
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:22.656
In March 1868 a twenty-nine-year-old Scot landed in San

6
00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:27.320
Francisco, asked a passer-by for the quickest way out of the

7
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:33.229
